OL,3,GNEWSAParking hike plan by leaderless
OL,4,Acouncil criticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome city parking charges could
OL,7,Fincrease by almost 8% next year, under
OL,8,Fproposals being put forward by a
OL,9,Fcouncil without any political
OL,10,Fleadership.
OL,12,FOfficers at Gloucester City Council are
OL,13,Frecommending the change, arguing that
OL,14,Fnot doing so would financially expose
OL,15,Fthe council to "a significant level of
OL,16,Frisk".
OL,18,FAndy Hearne, director of place, assets
OL,19,Fand regeneration, said the charges were
OL,20,Fas "fair, competitive and as low as
OL,21,Fpossible".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
