OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a spokesperson from Gloucester
OL,7,FBusiness Improvement District (BID)
OL,8,Fsaid the planned hike risked "becoming
OL,9,Fyet another reason for people to choose
OL,10,Fnot to visit the city centre".
